{\b aBookPlayer}\par
\par
Audiobook player with chapters, subtitles and local speech-to-text transcription.\par
\par
{\b Privacy}\par
aBookPlayer does not collect or send any data. Audio files never leave your computer: transcription runs locally. The only network access is the optional, one-time download of a Whisper speech model from Hugging Face, which happens only after you confirm it.\par
\par
Settings are stored in %APPDATA%\\aBookPlayer and downloaded models in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\aBookPlayer. They are kept when the app is uninstalled; delete those folders to remove them.\par
\par
